+        "An unordered JSON list of exactly m distinct monic linear polynomials "
+        "[c,1] over F_p, with coefficients in 0..p-1 and Vieta sum sum(c) "
+        "equal to the displayed t^(m-1) coefficient of h."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
